# SportClub API – testpäringud (Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code REST Client)
# 1) Käivita API (http://localhost:5080)
# 2) Käivita allpool sisselogimine ja kopeeri vastusest "token" sobivasse muutujasse.

@host = http://localhost:5080
@clientToken = PASTE_CLIENT_TOKEN
@trainerToken = PASTE_TRAINER_TOKEN
@adminToken = PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN
@serviceToken = PASTE_SERVICE_TOKEN

### ================= 1. Registreerimine ja sisselogimine =================

### Registreeri klient → 201 (vigased andmed → 400, e-post olemas → 409)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Anna Kask", "email": "anna.kask@mail.ee", "password": "Parool123" }

### Registreerimine: liiga lühike parool → 400
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Test", "email": "test@mail.ee", "password": "123" }

### Login klient
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "klient@sportclub.ee", "password": "Klient123!" }

### Login treener (Martin Kask)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "treener@sportclub.ee", "password": "Treener123!" }

### Login admin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@sportclub.ee", "password": "Admin123!" }

### Login Service (Worker)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "service@sportclub.ee", "password": "Service123!" }

### Vale parool → 401
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "klient@sportclub.ee", "password": "vale" }

### ================= 2. Külaline =================

### Tunniplaan – kõik
GET {{host}}/api/sessions

### Tunniplaan – periood ja tüüp
GET {{host}}/api/sessions?from=2026-11-27&to=2026-11-30&type=Jooga

### Tunniplaan – vale kuupäev → 400
GET {{host}}/api/sessions?from=27.11.2026

### Treenerid
GET {{host}}/api/trainers

### Treeneri treeningud
GET {{host}}/api/trainers/2/sessions

### Treeningutüübid
GET {{host}}/api/types

### Kuukaardi tariifid
GET {{host}}/api/pass-plans

### Külaline ei saa broneerida → 401
POST {{host}}/api/sessions/1/bookings

### ================= 3. Klient =================

### Minu kuukaart (puudub → 404)
GET {{host}}/api/passes/my
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### Osta kuukaart kaardiga (simuleeritud makse; aktiivne on juba olemas → 409)
POST {{host}}/api/passes
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "planId": 2, "cardNumber": "4242 4242 4242 4242", "cardHolder": "Karl Kask", "expiry": "12/28", "cvc": "123" }

### Osta kuukaart – pank lükkab tagasi → 402
POST {{host}}/api/passes
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "planId": 2, "cardNumber": "4000 0000 0000 0002", "cardHolder": "Karl Kask", "expiry": "12/28", "cvc": "123" }

### Registreeru treeningule (45 = homme 19:00 Crossfit, täis). Täis → 409 ja koht järjekorras
POST {{host}}/api/sessions/45/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### Ootejärjekorda (ülesande nõue; kohti on → 409)
POST {{host}}/api/sessions/45/waitlist
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### Minu broneeringud ja järjekorrakohad
GET {{host}}/api/bookings/my
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### Tühista broneering / lahku järjekorrast
DELETE {{host}}/api/bookings/1
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### ================= 4. Treener =================

### Minu treeningud (toimunud ja tulevased, staatusega)
GET {{host}}/api/trainer/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{trainerToken}}

### Osalejate nimekiri
GET {{host}}/api/sessions/32/attendance
Authorization: Bearer {{trainerToken}}

### Märgi kohalolu kõigile korraga (bookingId-d võta eelmisest vastusest)
PATCH {{host}}/api/sessions/32/attendance
Authorization: Bearer {{trainerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "bookingId": 1, "name": "Mari Tamm", "attended": true },
  { "bookingId": 2, "name": "Karl Lepp", "attended": false }
]

### Märgi ühe inimese kohalolu (ülesande nõue)
PATCH {{host}}/api/bookings/1/attendance
Authorization: Bearer {{trainerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "attended": true }

### Statistika (treener – ainult oma treeningud)
GET {{host}}/api/stats/popular
Authorization: Bearer {{trainerToken}}

### ================= 5. Admin =================

### Treener muutmiseks
GET {{host}}/api/trainers/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Lisa treener koos kontoga
POST {{host}}/api/trainers
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mari Tamm", "specialty": "Jooga", "description": "10 aastat kogemust",
  "phone": "+372 5555 1234", "email": "mari@sportclub.ee", "password": "Treener123" }

### Muuda treenerit
PUT {{host}}/api/trainers/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Kertu Saar", "specialty": "Jooga", "description": "12 aastat kogemust, ka pilates",
  "phone": "+372 5550 0001", "email": "kertu@sportclub.ee", "newPassword": "" }

### Kustuta treener (tulevased treeningud → 409)
DELETE {{host}}/api/trainers/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Lisa tüüp
POST {{host}}/api/types
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Zumba", "description": "Tantsuline aeroobika." }

### Tüüp muutmiseks
GET {{host}}/api/types/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Lisa treening
POST {{host}}/api/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "typeId": 1, "trainerId": 1, "date": "2026-12-20", "time": "18:00", "durationMinutes": 60, "capacity": 12 }

### Treening muutmiseks
GET {{host}}/api/sessions/45
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Muuda treeningut (rohkem kohti → Worker viib järjekorrast inimesi)
PUT {{host}}/api/sessions/45
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "typeId": 5, "trainerId": 2, "date": "2026-11-27", "time": "19:00", "durationMinutes": 60, "capacity": 5 }

### Kustuta treening (broneeringud tühistatakse, külastused tagastatakse)
DELETE {{host}}/api/sessions/45
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Lisa tariif
POST {{host}}/api/pass-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Nädalakaart", "visits": 5, "days": 7, "price": 19.90 }

### Eemalda tariif müügist
DELETE {{host}}/api/pass-plans/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Kõik broneeringud: otsing, filter, sorteerimine, leheküljed
GET {{host}}/api/bookings?search=mari&status=Booked&sort=Vanimad&page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Kõik kuukaardid
GET {{host}}/api/passes?search=karl
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Kasutajad
GET {{host}}/api/users?search=tamm
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Kustuta kasutaja (klient; iseennast/treenerit/taustateenust ei saa)
DELETE {{host}}/api/users/9
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Statistika (admin – kogu klubi)
GET {{host}}/api/stats/popular?from=2026-11-01
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ================= 6. Taustateenus =================

### Vii järjekorrast vabadele kohtadele (ka admin saab)
POST {{host}}/api/waitlist/promote
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceToken}}

### Tunni jooksul algavad treeningud
GET {{host}}/api/sessions/starting?within=60
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceToken}}

### Saada meeldetuletus (korduv → 409)
POST {{host}}/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookingId": 1 }

### Klient ei saa → 403
POST {{host}}/api/waitlist/promote
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
